{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一名男子下午在西貢踩單車跌倒，昏迷送東區醫院搶救。</p><p></p><p>60歲男子由政府飛行服務隊，送往東區醫院。事發在下午近4時半，警方接獲報案指，一名男子踩單車由榕樹澳往深涌碼頭，臨近碼頭時突然仆倒，面部流血、昏迷送院。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T11:56:44.548642+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T13:51:31.999723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T11:50:03.930964+00:00","content_hash":"6478a3ad4767572d25453930fd736100fc34d060395f8b0a1f337486db8090b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}